{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BCENnC3xoqwU8DeAZAwZfD","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-13-1830-increase-multistream-thread-count\n2\t\n3\tIncrease the multi-stream thread count from 4 to 8 for both Round 0 (`sumcheck_uni_round0_polys`) and GKR input evaluation (`log_gkr_input_evals`). At APC 300, each segment has ~310 AIRs launching kernels that occupy only 1-4 of the RTX 4090's 128 SMs. With 4 threads, effective parallelism is only 1.7-2.1x (measured via nsys kernel time vs wall time). Doubling to 8 threads increases concurrent kernel occupancy and reduces per-chunk imbalance, targeting a ~100-150ms reduction in STARK excl trace at APC 300.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6440d5e-5fb7-4583-a464-0e3f9791a04a","uuid":"56f271d1-86da-430b-a95b-c72a59ec730e","timestamp":"2026-04-13T03:25:04.034Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-13-1830-increase-multistream-thread-count\n\nIncrease the multi-stream thread count from 4 to 8 for both Round 0 (`sumcheck_uni_round0_polys`) and GKR input evaluation (`log_gkr_input_evals`). At APC 300, each segment has ~310 AIRs launching kernels that occupy only 1-4 of the RTX 4090's 128 SMs. With 4 threads, effective parallelism is only 1.7-2.1x (measured via nsys kernel time vs wall time). Doubling to 8 threads increases concurrent kernel occupancy and reduces per-chunk imbalance, targeting a ~100-150ms reduction in STARK excl trace at APC 300.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
